  {
    "name": "99920-2296-05-o5fx801v-us-en-tws-20/p1-b6-par1",
    "paragraph": {
      "id": "p1-b6-par1",
      "text": "Engine exhaust may ignite combustible\nmaterials and cause a fire.\nKeep the area around the exhaust outlet\nclear. Locate the unit so that the exhaust\noutlet points toward an open area and is\nlocated at least one meter (3.3 feet) from any",
      "box": { "x": 136, "y": 649, "width": 599, "height": 204 },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p1-b6-par1-l1",
          "text": "Engine exhaust may ignite combustible",
